> Secondly, what weapon should I get? Until now, I've just gone close combat,
> because I just keep dropping my weapon anyway while transforming, and because
> Eviscerate is quite useful. Now, however, my melee days seem to be over, because
> I won't be dropping my weapons anymore, and because I can't use Eviscerate while
> wearing them Gauntlets of Defense (a fact I only found out afterwards). Both
> Cleaver and Deathsword that're guaranteed for a barbarian seem fairly useless,
> anyway. What options do I have?

Bat From Hell is a good one, since it has a straight +20 damage
benefit, you can get skilled in it, and once you get stormbringer, you
can have the Bat in the offhand for a great bonus while draining
stuff.  I'd also recommend serpent's tongue (i'm currently playing a
necromancer, and this weapon alone is enough to make me forget they
are good spellcasters), which doubles damage against everything, and
has a chance of instakilling (or doing extra damage) non-poison
resistant monsters.

don't forget, that although weak fodder they may be, a magic whistle +
polytrap can turn them all into something pretty great (giant
shoggoths anyone?).


